Why Is Demand Increasing
Convenience and Speed: Busy lifestyles and demand for affordable meals are increasing preference for quick-service formats with shorter preparation and serving times.
Digital Transformation: Mobile ordering, digital menus, POS systems, self-service kiosks, and handheld devices are transforming restaurant operations and customer experiences.
Delivery and Mobile Payments: Expanding delivery ecosystems and mobile payment adoption are creating new revenue channels while improving ordering and payment convenience.

